":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T13:47:29Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T13:47:29Z","body":"I gave this branch a go on top of master and it works as advertised. 1440 draw calls down to 1 😎 \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1700\" height=\"813\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f482712-31b5-4e0c-a33d-00f69a9900dc\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4327488374/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329776861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112866#issuecomment-4329776861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112866","id":4329776861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAhMm3Q","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T19:17:14Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T19:17:14Z","body":"@fire No, skinned meshes are out of the scope which MultiMesh and EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing are meant to cover.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329776861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4374884108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112866#issuecomment-4374884108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112866","id":4374884108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBMNvDA","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-04T22:13:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T22:13:56Z","body":"Tested against master from 15min ago. Still working well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4374884108/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4391931564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112866#issuecomment-4391931564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112866","id":4391931564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBceOrA","user":{"login":"Ansraer","id":6329420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjk0MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6329420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer","html_url":"https://github.com/Ansraer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ansraer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T20:36:51Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T20:36:51Z","body":"Hmm, I wonder if it might make more sense to instead import a single mesh resource during import and have multiple MeshInstances that all reference that single mesh resource.\r\nIIRC we automatically batch MeshInstances that share a material and mesh together before they are rendered, so the gpu cost should be almost identical unless the instace count is very high.\r\nWith MI we would also get more accurate culling (since MMI are culled based on a combined AABB), which could be important for GPU perf if the meshes are on the heavy side.\r\n\r\nI am not convinced that this will necessarily result in better performance. I don't think we support combining multiple MultiMeshInstance, so each of them would end up as an individual draw call. So depending on the scene this might end up resulting in a performance regression compared to using duplicates as we currently do.\r\n\r\ne.g.: I have a table asset, which has 4 identical legs and one tabletop. I want to render 200 tables.\r\n\r\nWithout using any kind of instance import this would result in us rendering each of the table legs once and then the table top, each with 200 instances. So rendering my entire scene would happen with just 5 draw calls.\r\n\r\nHowever, if MultiMeshes are used instead (as implemented by this PR) we could now render a single table using one MeshInstance (top) and one MMI (the four legs). Since MMI can't automatically be combined rendering out entire scene would now take 201 draw calls. (200 * MMI + 1 mesh instance for the batched table tops).\r\n\r\nIf we instead could use MeshInstances for the leg instances and have all of them reference the same Mesh object we should be able to automatrically combine them when rendering, so the entire scene could be rendered with just two draw calls (one for all the legs, the other for the top).\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4391931564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4393920025","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112866#issuecomment-4393920025","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112866","id":4393920025,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBeXmGQ","user":{"login":"mikest","id":742517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/742517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest","html_url":"https://github.com/mikest","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikest/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T03:15:16Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T03:15:16Z","body":"> so the gpu cost should be almost identical unless the instace count is very high.\r\n\r\nI have instance counts that can reach tens of thousands (feathers, roof tiling, stone walls, etc). While the server can coalesce the meshes, the MeshInstance3D overhead from that is not negligible even when coalesced. \r\n\r\nThere is a separate issue with the blender importer not reusing mesh instances (outside of geometry nodes) that should also be fixed at some point, but that seems like a separate issue.\r\n\r\nRegardless, the current geometry node behavior is very taxing on performance.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4393920025/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4397058195","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112866#issuecomment-4397058195","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112866","id":4397058195,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBhXIkw","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-07T12:23:22Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T12:23:22Z","body":"@Ansraer This PR does not automatically combine anything into MultiMesh / MultiMeshInstance3D. It only generates MultiMeshInstance3D where `EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing` data exists in the glTF file. And that data only exists when the file author explicitly chose to use this technique when making the file.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4397058195/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]